      "text": "One of the Twelve. The name means a “twin,” and so it is translated in John 11:16 by the Greek Didymus. He is mentioned in the lists of Apostles (Matt. 10:3; Mark 3:18; Luke 6:15; Acts 1:13); and also in John 11:16; 14:5; 20:24, 28; 21:2.",
